## 7. Assumptions

1. The annual company budget has already been reviewed and approved.

2. Department budgets and budget lines are already available from an upstream planning or ERP system.

3. The prototype uses FY2027 sample data.

4. Each project allocation must be linked to one department and one budget line.

5. A cross-functional project may contain multiple departmental allocations.

6. Every expense request must be charged against one specific project allocation.

7. Actual payment execution happens outside the prototype; the application records Finance's payment confirmation and transfer-proof details.

8. Approved requests are treated as commitments until marked as paid.

9. Authentication and employee data are simulated through role switching.

10. Supporting documents are represented by placeholder attachments.

