## 10. Budget Structure

The application will use the following hierarchy:

```text
Approved Annual Company Budget
└── Department Budget
    └── Budget Line
        └── Project Allocation
            └── Expense Request
                ├── Commitment
                └── Actual Expense
```

Example:

```text
FY2027 Approved Budget
└── Technology Department
    └── Digital Products
        └── Ramadan Campaign Allocation: Rp800M
            └── Microsite Development Request: Rp150M
```

A project can aggregate several project allocations:

```text
Marketing Allocation ───── Rp2.5B ─┐
Technology Allocation ──── Rp0.8B ─┤
Operations Allocation ──── Rp1.2B ─┼─ Ramadan Campaign
Creative Allocation ────── Rp0.5B ─┘
```

