# 12.5 Create Expense Request

The system must allow a requester to submit an expense request against a project allocation.

### Required fields

* request title;
* project;
* requesting department;
* project allocation;
* workstream;
* expense category;
* vendor or recipient;
* requested amount;
* required date;
* business justification;
* attachment placeholder.

### Optional fields

* reference number;
* notes;
* related deliverable;
* cost breakdown.

### Budget validation

Before submission, the system must display:

* approved allocation;
* actual spending;
* committed amount;
* available budget;
* request amount;
* estimated remaining budget after approval.

### Validation rules

The system must:

* prevent requests with a zero or negative amount;
* require a project allocation;
* require a business justification;
* warn when a request consumes more than 80% of the available budget;
* block submission when the requested amount exceeds the available budget;
* display a clear budget-impact summary.

### Submission result

After submission:

* the request status becomes `Awaiting Manager Approval`;
* the requester receives a success message;
* the request appears in the relevant project and department views;
* no commitment is recorded until the request is approved.

