## 18. Alerts and Risk Indicators

The prototype should include a small number of high-value alerts.

### Budget alerts

* allocation utilization exceeds 80%;
* allocation utilization exceeds 95%;
* request exceeds available budget;
* department has excessive pending commitments;
* project has uneven utilization across departments.

### Workflow alerts

* request has been awaiting approval for more than five business days;
* request required date is approaching;
* revision has not been resubmitted;
* approved request is awaiting payment;
* payment is past its required date;
* transfer proof is missing;
* payment amount does not match the approved amount.

Example:

> Technology has utilized 87% of its Ramadan Campaign allocation.

