## 28. Demo Scenario

The recommended demo should follow one story:

1. Open the FY2027 annual budget dashboard.
2. Review the Technology department’s Rp60 billion annual budget.
3. Open the Digital Products budget line.
4. View its Rp800 million allocation to the Ramadan Campaign.
5. Open the Ramadan Campaign project dashboard.
6. Review allocations across Marketing, Technology, Operations, and Creative.
7. Switch to the Requester role.
8. Submit a Rp150 million microsite-development request.
9. Show the real-time budget impact.
10. Switch to the Department Manager role and approve the request.
11. Switch to the Finance role and complete the approval.
12. Open the Finance `Awaiting Payment` queue.
13. Record payment with date 18 February 2027, paid amount Rp150M, method Bank Transfer, beneficiary Digital Studio Indonesia, destination bank Bank Syariah Indonesia, and reference `TRX-20270218-8491`.
14. Upload `transfer-proof-RMD-2027-0042.pdf` and confirm payment.
15. Return to the project dashboard.
16. Show that the request is `Paid`, the commitment is removed, and actual spending increases by Rp150M.
17. Return to the Technology and annual-budget dashboards and show the same financial impact without a second reduction to available budget.
18. Open the activity timeline and show the payment confirmation, Finance user, timestamp, and transfer-proof filename.

This demonstrates that one financial request is visible from both project and departmental perspectives while being counted only once.

