## 29. Product Positioning

**Annual Budget & Cross-Functional Fund Management** is a budget execution and project fund-control platform that connects approved yearly budgets with cross-functional initiatives, day-to-day operational expense approvals, and payment confirmation.

Its primary value is:

> Providing one consolidated view of project spending while preserving clear departmental budget ownership and financial accountability.
